h humans and monsters could live in peace. A city called\u2026 KindFolx.\n\nBut after his death, a monsterfolk named Darlocke rose to power and became its new leader. Their influence, fueled by human hatred, shackled and oppressed only the wealthiest and influential of humans.\n\nUnwilling to allow history to repeat itself, the adventurers guild assembles, and steps forth to liberate KindFolx from the darkness at its core!\n\nWill you and the Adventurers Guild be able to successfully defeat the evil in the deepest parts of the city?", "summary": "KindFolx is a fast-paced deckbuilding roguelike where real-time action meets tactical card combat. Play as one of three monsterfolk heroes and battle through randomized encounters, evolving your deck and strategy to take down a ruthless tyrant.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/kindfolx", "videos": [{"id": 153998, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "mPB64BG0N6U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mPB64BG0N6U", "title": "KindFolx PC Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mPB64BG0N6U/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 154015, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5dXqtRqzFEA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5dXqtRqzFEA", "title": "KindFolx - Official Trailer | The MIX Next August 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5dXqtRqzFEA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 154016, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "HQl0dJTRDtw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HQl0dJTRDtw", "title": "KindFolx Adventurer Trailer #2", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HQl0dJTRDtw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 154017, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "depd6yjQoXQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=depd6yjQoXQ", "title": "KindFolx Preview Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/depd6yjQoXQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 162367, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "XKZCtF_rafs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XKZCtF_ra